 "title": "Coefficient dual on $X$",
 "statement": "In the Poincare duality conventions of this chapter (the fixed setting),\n$K\\in D^b_{ctf}(X,\\Lambda)$. The *coefficient dual* is\n\n$$\nK^\\vee=R\\mathcal Hom_X\\bigl(K,\\Lambda_X\\bigr),\n$$\n\nwith the canonical evaluation\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{ev}_K:K\\otimes^L_{\\Lambda_X}K^\\vee\\longrightarrow\\Lambda_X\n$$\n\nof the tensor–internal-Hom adjunction.",
